950,blR:16,blSets:2,blSetGap:.9,blSides:[`top`,`left`],blPink:[3,1,2,0],blTopY:46,blTopX:[.12,.24,.36,.48],blLeftX:46,blLeftH:[70,140,210,280],blEnd:.8,_bt:`Monitor Crash = Sally's lightning: the monitors flash (the sign, btSign s), then btN bolts (2-4: sourced); each locks on where the target stands (marker), strikes that column btTele s later for btHit s. Keep moving.`,btLead:.3,btSign:.6,btN:[2,3,4,3],btGap:.75,btTele:.7,btHit:.25,btW:80,btEnd:.5,_hs:`Remix = Beppi's Charlie Horse: a colour cue (hsCue s) sets it, alternating. Yellow: a row of horseshoes appears high above the target with a gap (hsGapOff from the target), hovers hsHover s (the warning), drops; stand in the gap (hsRows rows). Green: horseshoe magnets in gnGroups groups of gnPer (sourced 2 x 2) fly across in a wave; one is pink.`,hsCols:[`yellow`,`green`],hsCue:.8,hsRows:2,hsRowGap:1.7,hsHover:.9,hsY:60,hsSp:72,hsX0:80,hsGapOff:[190,-230,260,-170],hsG:2400,hsR:22,gnGroups:2,gnPer:2,gnGroupGap:1.4,gnPairGap:.35,gnV:480,gnAmp:95,gnY:120,gnOm:3.2,gnPink:[3,0,2,1],gnR:24,hsEnd:.6,seq:{1:[`charge`,`magnet`,`drop`],2:[`walls`,`kiss2`,`walls`,`blades`],3:[`bolts`,`horse`,`bolts`,`horse`]},pause:[.7,.45,.25],p2:.66,p3:.33,hbL:150,hbR:150,hbTop:330,hbP3:{_:`D23: the Phantom Monarch's hit box (phase 3, and transition B from fromTransB s, the 3D swap), up to the bigger pack model. D24: the model moved back 150 (render), the box follows it (hbL 420 -> 265, hbR -20 -> 160).`,hbL:265,hbR:160,hbTop:430,fromTransB:1.4},_cb:`D24 body contact [x from f.x, height, r]: the Jester (cb: body, head) and the Phantom Monarch (cbP3: cloak, head), fitted to the pack models after they moved back (cammyView ART_DX)`,cb:[[-15,130,115],[30,245,80]],cbP3:[[-50,150,150],[-70,333,95]],flipChance:.5,contactGrace:.4,wall:240,bodyW:119,bodyH:204,emoteR:22,transT:{A:3,B:3},bgBase:.9,glow:[`#5ee6c8`,`#6aa8ff`,`#e8f0ff`],mons:[[.08,.1,150,95],[.28,.06,120,80],[.5,.12,170,105],[.7,.07,130,85]],spamWind:.6,spamLead:.35,spamVolleys:2,spamGap